                    },
                    "message": "Hi, @patrick@stwcx.xyz @paligill@gmail.com\nRegarding adding an SEL when a metric exceeds or falls below its configured threshold, we are considering two approaches:\n\nPatchset 5 \u2013 reuse the existing \"Log\" option to control whether an SEL is added.\n\nPatchset 6 \u2013 introduce a new \"SEL\" option to explicitly control whether an SEL is added.\n\nDo you have any advice or preference between these two approaches?"
